  &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 16px 0;&quot;&gt;
    We wanted to send a quick reminder regarding the open feedback you have pending.
  &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 16px 0;&quot;&gt;
    If you’d like to share input — including recognition for teammates or suggestions for improvement — please use the link below. The feedback window will close in &lt;strong&gt;4 days&lt;/strong&gt;.
  &lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;table role=&quot;presentation&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;margin:0 0 16px 0;&quot;&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;
